  "description": "Taxidermist Do-Yeon steals his dead lover's body. Lee Myeong, a writer who witnessed this, demands Do-Yeon's life as a subject in exchange for silence. Do-Yeon, who allows a week of coverage, is confused by the appearance of Lee Myeong, who looks just like her dead lover. The week of coverage begins in an isolated studio in the forest. A man who looks exactly like his dead lover, is that really his only purpose? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
